soar between towering skyscrapers.\n\nIn this dystopian world, you are a rogue operative hunted by powerful factions. Use stealth to disappear into the darkness or engage in high-speed chases across neon-lit rooftops. Chain together fluid movement combos to outmaneuver enemies, hack security systems, and take down threats with lightning-fast precision. Every mission is a test of skill, speed, and strategy.\n\nThe city never sleeps. The danger never stops. Will you rise from the shadows or be consumed by them?", "short_description": "Project Dark VR\n\nStep into the shadows with Project Dark VR, an intense, fast-paced virtual reality experience where fluid movement is your greatest weapon. Traverse a cyber-noir city using seamless parkour, wall-running, and a high-tech grappling system. Engage in stealthy takedowns or high-speed chases as you uncover the mysteries lurking in the neon-lit underworld.\n\nMove like a ghost. Strike like a shadow. Welcome to Project Dark."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://doc-hosting.flycricket.io/project-dark-privacy-policy/b0f9eae0-32b4-43b9-bd2f-1117addc9bf3/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dark", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-darkfaegfefefafwafwa?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interacti